    {
      "id":"EVT_XUTIAN_001","version":1,"title":"月沉沧海","body":"雾澜群岛流传着月沉海底、古宫开门的传说。这一夜，海上明月果然化作一道银色漩涡，沉没万年的沧海宫随之浮出水面。宫门只在月影最低时开启，各方结丹修士已经在海面等候多日。",
      "tags":["realm:core","world:human","story_chain","xutian","probability_gate"],"weight":0,"repeat":"once","trigger":{"milestone":"xutian_eligible","base_chance":0.18,"unit_increment":0.02},
      "conditions":{"all":[{"path":"player.world","op":"eq","value":"human"},{"path":"player.realm_index","op":"eq","value":3}]},
      "choices":[
        {"id":"map","text":"依照残图，在月影中寻找正门","effects":[{"type":"set_flag","flag":"xutian_entered"},{"type":"queue_event","event_id":"EVT_XUTIAN_002"}]},
        {"id":"crowd","text":"与诸修合力破开外宫水幕","effects":[{"type":"set_flag","flag":"xutian_entered"},{"type":"add_karma","value":2},{"type":"queue_event","event_id":"EVT_XUTIAN_002"}]},
